    <h1>How To Get More <span class="amber">Homeowner Leads</span> As A Tradesman</h1>
    <p class="lede">The most reliable way to get more homeowner leads is to stop leaning on word of mouth and put a system in place that brings enquiries in on demand: local ads, real footage of your work, and a funnel that filters the time-wasters. Here's how it works, and how to start.</p>
  </div>
